### ─── WORK ORDERS ───────────────────────────────────────

### Create work order for asset 1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/WorkOrders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assetId": 1,
  "maintenanceType": 1,
  "priority": 2,
  "estimatedHours": 2,
  "requestedDate": "2026-07-28T00:00:00Z",
  "dueDate": "2026-07-30T00:00:00Z"
}

### ─── ASSIGNMENTS ───────────────────────────────────────

### FR-4: Assign Ahmed 09:00-11:00 (should succeed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workOrderId": 1,
  "engineerId": 1,
  "scheduledStart": "2026-07-28T09:00:00Z",
  "scheduledEnd": "2026-07-28T11:00:00Z"
}

### FR-5: Overlapping slot 10:30-12:00 (should FAIL 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workOrderId": 1,
  "engineerId": 1,
  "scheduledStart": "2026-07-28T10:30:00Z",
  "scheduledEnd": "2026-07-28T12:00:00Z"
}

### FR-4: Outside working hours 06:00-07:00 (should FAIL 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workOrderId": 1,
  "engineerId": 1,
  "scheduledStart": "2026-07-28T06:00:00Z",
  "scheduledEnd": "2026-07-28T07:00:00Z"
}

### FR-4: Assign Sara 09:00-11:00 (should succeed — different engineer)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workOrderId": 1,
  "engineerId": 2,
  "scheduledStart": "2026-07-28T09:00:00Z",
  "scheduledEnd": "2026-07-28T11:00:00Z"
}

### Get assignment by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET all assignments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### FR-6: Reschedule assignment 1 to 13:00-15:00 (should succeed)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignments/1/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newScheduledStart": "2026-07-28T13:00:00Z",
  "newScheduledEnd": "2026-07-28T15:00:00Z",
  "changeReason": "Client requested afternoon slot"
}

### FR-6: Reschedule to conflicting slot (should FAIL 409)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignments/1/reschedule
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newScheduledStart": "2026-07-28T10:00:00Z",
  "newScheduledEnd": "2026-07-28T13:00:00Z",
  "changeReason": "Test conflict"
}

### Update status to InProgress (3)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 3
}

### Update status to Completed (4)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignments/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 4
}

### Cancel assignment
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/Assignments/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Engineers
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Engineers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Engineer workload
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Engineers/1/workload?date=2026-07-28
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Assets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Assets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}